{"unit_id":"HB123X__dsh-ponytail#card-zh","repo":"HB123X/dsh-ponytail","commit":"9f061d51e7b3d3cbf9fc84a19881392eacfbfc37","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ponytail 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的提示词插件，在每次模型步骤前注入一套鼓励复用原生能力、标准库和已有代码的精简编程规则。它在对话输入框提供 Ponytail 档位选择器，并在设置页提供总开关；用户可切换 Off、Lite、Full、Ultra 四种强度，变更会在下一步生效。插件还通过本机状态接口同步界面与主进程，并把开关和档位保存到 DSH 状态目录。适合希望减少生成代码和 token、同时保留需求校验与错误处理的 DSH 用户；无需额外账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48-93","lib/index.js:106-163","lib/client.js:206-229"]}
{"unit_id":"HB123X__dsh-ponytail#card-en","repo":"HB123X/dsh-ponytail","commit":"9f061d51e7b3d3cbf9fc84a19881392eacfbfc37","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ponytail adds concise coding prompts to DSH Web, favoring native features, standard libraries, and existing code. Choose Off, Lite, Full, or Ultra in the composer; Settings has a master switch. The mode and switch persist locally. No account or API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48-93","lib/index.js:106-163","lib/client.js:206-229"]}
